# Scenario 'settings_cgi': モバイルせってい against differently answering DION CGI servers. The ROM's response format for the
# daa_gb_*.cgi / utility requests is not documented, so this scenario probes it with the fake-Internet option `cgi=STATUS/GBSTATUS/AUTH/CTYPE/HEXBODY`
# (mgba_trace.c): each attempt is a power cycle (`reset`) followed by title -> モバイルせってい -> パスワードの変更 (two password entries, dial
# 9477, POST daa_gb_pwdchg.cgi) with another answer: 200 x-cgb without body / with a 4-zero body / with ASCII "0000", 401 with a
# WWW-Authenticate: GB00 challenge, 200 with such a challenge, 200 with Gb-Status 200 / 123, 500. The ROM turns the answer into the error screens
# 40-????, 32-401, 20-000, 33-nnn, 32-500 (Gb-Status nnn -> 33-nnn). The usage-time and usage-fee flows follow for two of the answers.
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (password aZ01). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# --- attempt cgb_empty: cgi=200/-/-/cgb/-
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
net cgi=200/-/-/cgb/-
# --- 1. change password
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_change_explain
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_current_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_confirm
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_change_confirm_dial
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 900
shot cgb_empty_pw_change
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 90
shot cgb_empty_menu
